TEXT	gb1.wav	My fellow Americans, this day has brought terrible news and great sadness to our country. At nine o'clock this morning, Mission Control in Houston lost contact with our space shuttle Columbia. A short time later, debris was seen falling from the skies above Texas. The Columbia is lost. There are no survivors. In the words of the prophet Isaiah, May God bless the grieving families and may God continue to bless America.
